    {
      "source": "Creates a new <a href=\"UpdateMapper.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.convert\"><code>UpdateMapper</code></a> using the given <a href=\"MongoConverter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.convert\"><code>MongoConverter</code></a>.",
      "translation": "使用给定的<a href=\"MongoConverter.html\" title=\"接口在 org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.convert 中\"><code>MongoConverter</code></a>创建一个新的<a href=\"UpdateMapper.html\" title=\"类在 org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.convert 中\"><code>UpdateMapper</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Replaces the property keys used in the given <code>Document</code> with the appropriate keys by using the\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/mapping/PersistentEntity.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentEntity</code></a> metadata.",
      "translation": "使用 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/mapping/PersistentEntity.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentEntity</code></a> 元数据，将给定 <code>Document</code> 中使用的属性键替换为适当的键。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Extracts the mapped object value for given field out of rawValue taking nested <code>QueryMapper.Keyword</code>s into account",
      "translation": "从 rawValue 中提取给定字段对应的映射对象值，同时考虑嵌套的<code>QueryMapper.Keyword</code>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns true if the given <code>Document</code> is an update object that uses update operators.",
      "translation": "如果给定的 `<code>Document</code>` 是使用更新操作符的更新对象，则返回 true。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Converts the given source object to a mongo type retaining the original type information of the source type on the\nmongo type.",
      "translation": "将给定的源对象转换为 MongoDB 类型，同时保留源类型的原始类型信息。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
