    {
      "source": "Returns whether the given <a href=\"QueryMapper.Field.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.convert\"><code>QueryMapper.Field</code></a> represents an association reference that together with the given value\nrequires conversion to a <a href=\"../mapping/DBRef.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.mapping\"><code>DBRef</code></a> object. We check whether the\ntype of the given value is compatible with the type of the given document field in order to deal with potential\nquery field exclusions, since MongoDB uses the <code>int</code> 0 as an indicator for an excluded field.",
      "translation": "返回给定的<a href=\"QueryMapper.Field.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.convert\"><code>QueryMapper.Field</code></a>是否表示一个关联引用，该引用与给定值一起需要转换为<a href=\"../mapping/DBRef.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.mapping\"><code>DBRef</code></a>对象。我们检查给定值的类型是否与给定文档字段的类型兼容，以处理潜在的查询字段排除问题，因为 MongoDB 使用<code>int</code> 0 作为被排除字段的指示符。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns whether the given <a href=\"QueryMapper.Field.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.convert\"><code>QueryMapper.Field</code></a> represents an association reference that together with the given value\nrequires conversion to a <a href=\"../mapping/DBRef.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.mapping\"><code>DBRef</code></a> object.",
